Real cameras are not perfect pinhole cameras.

They exhibit distortion.

Radial Distortion

Common in wide-angle cameras.

Let

r2=x2+y2r^2=x^2+y^2

Then

xd=x(1+k1r2+k2r4+k3r6)x_d=x(1+k_1r^2+k_2r^4+k_3r^6) yd=y(1+k1r2+k2r4+k3r6)y_d=y(1+k_1r^2+k_2r^4+k_3r^6)

where:

k1,k2,k3k_1,k_2,k_3

are distortion parameters.

Tangential Distortion

